      "content": "4.1 State Government Structure"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The State Government Structure encompasses the constitutional roles of the Governor, State Legislature, and the chronological timeline of Gujarat's Chief Ministers.",
        "Local Self-Government in Gujarat is bifurcated into Urban Local Bodies and Rural Local Bodies (Panchayati Raj).",
        "Specific Constitutional Provisions dictate the governance framework and state-level powers in Gujarat.",
        "Socio-economic growth and administration are supported through targeted Important Government Schemes of Gujarat."
      ],
